Medusa
Copyright 2026 HARTLE.TECH (NIPC 518241327, Porto, Portugal)

A HARTLE.TECH research project for embedded wireless reconnaissance,
defensive network posture analysis, and educational pentest tooling on
microcontroller hardware. Sibling to Nosferato (single-board-computer
lane) and companion to NearTrace (Android BLE scanner).

